  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Border Management and Security Practices at Points of Entry in Aqaba Governorate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will support the Government of Jordan in their efforts to strengthen border management and security practices at points of entry (PoE), and for border authorities to adhere to international standards and best practices for combatting transitional organized crime and terrorism at PoE while ensuring the continuity of cross-border traffic.</narrative>
  </description>
